Modifications include local listening-based Home recommendations and history,
continuous Radio and Radio Mix queues, Following and Stats, Library/search UI,
equalizer controls, backup, downloads, playback preparation/recovery, Android
Auto browsing and voice requests, branding and build/release packaging.
This build refreshes Spotify library writes, adds playlist song editing and
library song selection, visible song menus and an audio output chooser.
Features are subject to the validation limits in MODIFIED_VERIFICATION.md.

